alse, "private": false}, "slug": "office-francais-de-la-biodiversite", "uri": "https://www.data.gouv.fr/api/1/organizations/office-francais-de-la-biodiversite/"}, "owner": null, "role": "contact"}, {"contact_form": null, "email": "manon.tranchand@i-sea.fr", "id": "695da3000139d2f8f2842e98", "name": "Manon Tranchand (i-Sea)", "organization": {"acronym": "OFB", "badges": [{"kind": "certified"}, {"kind": "public-service"}], "class": "Organization", "id": "5d7f937b8b4c4165718fbff1", "logo": "https://udata-avatars.s3.rbx.io.cloud.ovh.net/00/43a5d806674e8782299d24db8329d0.png", "logo_thumbnail": "https://udata-avatars.s3.rbx.io.cloud.ovh.net/00/43a5d806674e8782299d24db8329d0-100.png", "name": "Office Fran\u00e7ais de la Biodiversit\u00e9", "page": "https://www.data.gouv.fr/organizations/office-francais-de-la-biodiversite", "permissions": {"delete": false, "edit": false, "harvest": false, "members": false, "private": false}, "slug": "office-francais-de-la-biodiversite", "uri": "https://www.data.gouv.fr/api/1/organizations/office-francais-de-la-biodiversite/"}, "owner": null, "role": "contact"}, {"contact_form": null, "email": "nicolas.durou@i-sea.fr", "id": "695da3000139d2f8f2842eab", "name": "Nicolas Durou (i-Sea)", "organization": {"acronym": "OFB", "badges": [{"kind": "certified"}, {"kind": "public-service"}], "class": "Organization", "id": "5d7f937b8b4c4165718fbff1", "logo": "https://udata-avatars.s3.rbx.io.cloud.ovh.net/00/43a5d806674e8782299d24db8329d0.png", "logo_thumbnail": "https://udata-avatars.s3.rbx.io.cloud.ovh.net/00/43a5d806674e8782299d24db8329d0-100.png", "name": "Office Fran\u00e7ais de la Biodiversit\u00e9", "page": "https://www.data.gouv.fr/organizations/office-francais-de-la-biodiversite", "permissions": {"delete": false, "edit": false, "harvest": false, "members": false, "private": false}, "slug": "office-francais-de-la-biodiversite", "uri": "https://www.data.gouv.fr/api/1/organizations/office-francais-de-la-biodiversite/"}, "owner": null, "role": "contact"}, {"contact_form": null, "email": "olivier.regniers@i-sea.fr", "id": "695da3000139d2f8f2842eb7", "name": "REGNIERS Olivier (i-Sea)", "organization": {"acronym": "OFB", "badges": [{"kind": "certified"}, {"kind": "public-service"}], "class": "Organization", "id": "5d7f937b8b4c4165718fbff1", "logo": "https://udata-avatars.s3.rbx.io.cloud.ovh.net/00/43a5d806674e8782299d24db8329d0.png", "logo_thumbnail": "https://udata-avatars.s3.rbx.io.cloud.ovh.net/00/43a5d806674e8782299d24db8329d0-100.png", "name": "Office Fran\u00e7ais de la Biodiversit\u00e9", "page": "https://www.data.gouv.fr/organizations/office-francais-de-la-biodiversite", "permissions": {"delete": false, "edit": false, "harvest": false, "members": false, "private": false}, "slug": "office-francais-de-la-biodiversite", "uri": "https://www.data.gouv.fr/api/1/organizations/office-francais-de-la-biodiversite/"}, "owner": null, "role": "creator"}, {"contact_form": null, "email": "gregory.agin@ofb.gouv.fr", "id": "695da3000139d2f8f2842ecb", "name": "Gr\u00e9gory AGIN (Office fran\u00e7ais de la biodiversit\u00e9)", "organization": {"acronym": "OFB", "badges": [{"kind": "certified"}, {"kind": "public-service"}], "class": "Organization", "id": "5d7f937b8b4c4165718fbff1", "logo": "https://udata-avatars.s3.rbx.io.cloud.ovh.net/00/43a5d806674e8782299d24db8329d0.png", "logo_thumbnail": "https://udata-avatars.s3.rbx.io.cloud.ovh.net/00/43a5d806674e8782299d24db8329d0-100.png", "name": "Office Fran\u00e7ais de la Biodiversit\u00e9", "page": "https://www.data.gouv.fr/organizations/office-francais-de-la-biodiversite", "permissions": {"delete": false, "edit": false, "harvest": false, "members": false, "private": false}, "slug": "office-francais-de-la-biodiversite", "uri": "https://www.data.gouv.fr/api/1/organizations/office-francais-de-la-biodiversite/"}, "owner": null, "role": "rightsHolder"}], "created_at": "2024-11-12T00:00:00+00:00", "deleted": null, "description": "Le PNMGL souhaite se doter d\u2019un syst\u00e8me de surveillance de certains param\u00e8tres critiques de la qualit\u00e9 de l\u2019eau (turbidit\u00e9, concentration en chlorophylle-a) qui pourra alimenter \u00e0 terme un tableau de bord utile \u00e0 la gestion. Cette \u00e9tude men\u00e9e par i-Sea en 2024 vise donc \u00e0 prototyper une solution valorisant les donn\u00e9es satellitaires disponibles en open data (ESA Copernicus) et \u00e0 faire la d\u00e9monstration en conditions r\u00e9elles de sa plus-value par l\u2019analyse de l\u2019archive historique satellitaire.  \n\nAu cours de cette \u00e9tude, un focus a \u00e9t\u00e9 men\u00e9 sur trois lagunes littorales proches du PNMGL, les \u00e9tangs de La Palme, de Leucate et de Canet. Des chronologies de turbidit\u00e9 ont \u00e9t\u00e9 produites sur l\u2019emprise de ces 3 lagunes \u00e0 partir de l\u2019ensemble de l\u2019archive de donn\u00e9es Sentinel-2. La m\u00e9thode d\u2019estimation a \u00e9t\u00e9 adapt\u00e9e afin de tenir compte de la faible profondeur des lagunes et l\u2019impact du fond sur la radiom\u00e9trie. L\u2019ensemble des fonds visibles par transparence sont masqu\u00e9s dans les produits.  \n\nCette base de donn\u00e9es contient 199 images Sentinel-2 entre ao\u00fbt 2015 et juin 2024. \n\nLes produits de turbidit\u00e9 sont accompagn\u00e9s des images en vraies couleurs (TC = True Color) afin de faciliter l\u2019interpr\u00e9tation des r\u00e9sultats. \n\nNomenclature de la donn\u00e9e : phy_med_pnmgl_suivisat_sentinel2_YYYYMMDD_laguneCanet_TUR_isea_ofb_ras_32631.tif \n\nO\u00f9 YYYY = ann\u00e9e, MM = mois, DD = jour. TUR = Turbidit\u00e9.", "description_short": null, "doi": null, "extras": {"dcat": {"provenance": ["Quel que soit le capteur cibl\u00e9 (S2 ou S3), les valeurs de turbidit\u00e9 sont d\u00e9riv\u00e9es des images de r\u00e9flectance marine en utilisant un algorithme semi-analytique g\u00e9n\u00e9rique propos\u00e9 par Dogliotti et al. (2015). Il est utilis\u00e9 conjointement \u00e0 une approche multi-conditionnelle de combinaison de bandes (Novoa et al., 2017), afin de couvrir une large gamme de turbidit\u00e9. \n\nAfin de masquer les pixels impact\u00e9s par les fonds visibles par transparence, une climatologie de r\u00e9flectance moyenne a \u00e9t\u00e9 estim\u00e9e sur la lagune. Seuls les pixels de r\u00e9flectances significativement sup\u00e9rieures \u00e0 cette climatologie sont convertis en turbidit\u00e9, les autres sont masqu\u00e9s. \n\nLes images Sentinel-2 en vraies couleurs sont \u00e9galement extraites des images brutes (TCI) fournies par l\u2019ESA selon l\u2019emprise de la lagune cibl\u00e9e. Elles accompagnent les produits de turbidit\u00e9 afin d\u2019en faciliter l\u2019interpr\u00e9tation."], "spatial_resolution": "10 m"}, "ecologie:universe": true}, "featured": false, "frequency": "punctual", "frequency_date": null, "geopf": null, "harvest": {"backend": "CSW-ISO-19139", "created_at": "2024-11-12T00:00:00+00:00", "dct_identifier": "http://data.ofb.fr/b2768978-173b-495e-bd22-cb6bf51bc37c", "domain": "data.ofb.fr", "issued_at": "2024-11-12T00:00:00+00:00", "last_update": "2026-11-27T00:04:47.134000+00:00", "record_id": "5c7affb3-49cb-4cae-a6bf-3fe802a0c765", "remote_id": "http://data.ofb.fr/b2768978-173b-495e-bd22-cb6bf51bc37c", "remote_url": "https://data.ofb.fr/catalogue/Donnees-geographiques-OFB/fre/catalog.search#/metadata/5c7affb3-49cb-4cae-a6bf-3fe802a0c765", "source_id": "684af36aeb4fcb5ce4f438bc", "source_url": "https://data.ofb.fr/catalogue/Donnees-geographiques-OFB/fre/csw", "uri": "http://data.ofb.fr/b2768978-173b-495e-bd22-cb6bf51bc37c"}, "id": "6888c33d441fa32e35cf50b7", "internal": {"created_at_internal": "2025-07-29T12:49:01.002000+00:00", "last_modified_internal": "2026-10-02T13:57:57.391000+00:00"}, "last_modified": "2026-10-02T13:57:57.391000+00:00", "last_update": "2026-10-02T13:57:57.391000+00:00", "license": "notspecified", "metrics": {"dataservices": 0, "discussions": 0, "discussions_open": 0, "followers": 0, "followers_by_months": {"2025-01":