iodiversit\u00e9", "page": "https://www.data.gouv.fr/organizations/office-francais-de-la-biodiversite", "permissions": {"delete": false, "edit": false, "harvest": false, "members": false, "private": false}, "slug": "office-francais-de-la-biodiversite", "uri": "https://www.data.gouv.fr/api/1/organizations/office-francais-de-la-biodiversite/"}, "owner": null, "role": "contact"}, {"contact_form": null, "email": "nicolas.durou@i-sea.fr", "id": "695da3000139d2f8f2842eab", "name": "Nicolas Durou (i-Sea)", "organization": {"acronym": "OFB", "badges": [{"kind": "certified"}, {"kind": "public-service"}], "class": "Organization", "id": "5d7f937b8b4c4165718fbff1", "logo": "https://udata-avatars.s3.rbx.io.cloud.ovh.net/00/43a5d806674e8782299d24db8329d0.png", "logo_thumbnail": "https://udata-avatars.s3.rbx.io.cloud.ovh.net/00/43a5d806674e8782299d24db8329d0-100.png", "name": "Office Fran\u00e7ais de la Biodiversit\u00e9", "page": "https://www.data.gouv.fr/organizations/office-francais-de-la-biodiversite", "permissions": {"delete": false, "edit": false, "harvest": false, "members": false, "private": false}, "slug": "office-francais-de-la-biodiversite", "uri": "https://www.data.gouv.fr/api/1/organizations/office-francais-de-la-biodiversite/"}, "owner": null, "role": "contact"}, {"contact_form": null, "email": "olivier.regniers@i-sea.fr", "id": "695da3000139d2f8f2842eb7", "name": "REGNIERS Olivier (i-Sea)", "organization": {"acronym": "OFB", "badges": [{"kind": "certified"}, {"kind": "public-service"}], "class": "Organization", "id": "5d7f937b8b4c4165718fbff1", "logo": "https://udata-avatars.s3.rbx.io.cloud.ovh.net/00/43a5d806674e8782299d24db8329d0.png", "logo_thumbnail": "https://udata-avatars.s3.rbx.io.cloud.ovh.net/00/43a5d806674e8782299d24db8329d0-100.png", "name": "Office Fran\u00e7ais de la Biodiversit\u00e9", "page": "https://www.data.gouv.fr/organizations/office-francais-de-la-biodiversite", "permissions": {"delete": false, "edit": false, "harvest": false, "members": false, "private": false}, "slug": "office-francais-de-la-biodiversite", "uri": "https://www.data.gouv.fr/api/1/organizations/office-francais-de-la-biodiversite/"}, "owner": null, "role": "creator"}, {"contact_form": null, "email": "gregory.agin@ofb.gouv.fr", "id": "695da3000139d2f8f2842ecb", "name": "Gr\u00e9gory AGIN (Office fran\u00e7ais de la biodiversit\u00e9)", "organization": {"acronym": "OFB", "badges": [{"kind": "certified"}, {"kind": "public-service"}], "class": "Organization", "id": "5d7f937b8b4c4165718fbff1", "logo": "https://udata-avatars.s3.rbx.io.cloud.ovh.net/00/43a5d806674e8782299d24db8329d0.png", "logo_thumbnail": "https://udata-avatars.s3.rbx.io.cloud.ovh.net/00/43a5d806674e8782299d24db8329d0-100.png", "name": "Office Fran\u00e7ais de la Biodiversit\u00e9", "page": "https://www.data.gouv.fr/organizations/office-francais-de-la-biodiversite", "permissions": {"delete": false, "edit": false, "harvest": false, "members": false, "private": false}, "slug": "office-francais-de-la-biodiversite", "uri": "https://www.data.gouv.fr/api/1/organizations/office-francais-de-la-biodiversite/"}, "owner": null, "role": "rightsHolder"}], "created_at": "2024-11-12T00:00:00+00:00", "deleted": null, "description": "Le PNMGL souhaite se doter d\u2019un syst\u00e8me de surveillance de certains param\u00e8tres critiques de la qualit\u00e9 de l\u2019eau (turbidit\u00e9, concentration en chlorophylle-a) qui pourra alimenter \u00e0 terme un tableau de bord utile \u00e0 la gestion. Cette \u00e9tude men\u00e9e par i-Sea en 2024 vise donc \u00e0 prototyper une solution valorisant les donn\u00e9es satellitaires disponibles en open data (ESA Copernicus) et \u00e0 faire la d\u00e9monstration en conditions r\u00e9elles de sa plus-value par l\u2019analyse de l\u2019archive historique satellitaire.  \n\nAu cours de cette \u00e9tude, l\u2019ensemble des images Sentinel-2 couvrant l\u2019emprise du PNMGL et un p\u00e9rim\u00e8tre \u00e9largi de 25 km autour du Parc ont \u00e9t\u00e9 collect\u00e9es et converties en turbidit\u00e9 et concentration en chlorophylle. Seules les images associ\u00e9es \u00e0 une couverture nuageuse limit\u00e9e (< 70%) ont \u00e9t\u00e9 analys\u00e9es. \n\nCette base de donn\u00e9es contient 159 images Sentinel-2 entre ao\u00fbt 2015 et avril 2024. \n\nLes produits de turbidit\u00e9 et de concentration en chlorophylle sont accompagn\u00e9s des images en vraies couleurs (TC = True Color) afin de faciliter l\u2019interpr\u00e9tation des r\u00e9sultats. \n\nNomenclature de la donn\u00e9e : phy_med_pnmgl_suivisat_sentinel2_YYYYMMDD_CHL_isea_ofb_ras_32631.tif \n\nO\u00f9 YYYY = ann\u00e9e, MM = mois, DD = jour. CHL = concentration en chlorophylle.", "description_short": null, "doi": null, "extras": {"dcat": {"provenance": ["Les images Sentinel-2 (niveau L1C) sont pr\u00e9trait\u00e9es afin de masquer les pixels invalides (terre, nuages, ombres de nugaes, no data, etc.), de corriger les effets atmosph\u00e9riques (conversion en r\u00e9flectance marine) et de d\u00e9couper l\u2019image selon l\u2019emprise d\u2019\u00e9tude. \n\nLes valeurs de turbidit\u00e9 sont d\u00e9riv\u00e9es des images de r\u00e9flectance marine en utilisant un algorithme semi-analytique g\u00e9n\u00e9rique propos\u00e9 par Dogliotti et al. (2015). Il est utilis\u00e9 conjointement \u00e0 une approche multi-conditionnelle de combinaison de bandes (Novoa et al., 2017), afin de couvrir une large gamme de turbidit\u00e9. \n\nDans le cas de la chlorophylle, deux algorithmes empiriques sont utilis\u00e9s conjointement \u00e0 une approche de pond\u00e9ration par pixel (Lavigne et al., 2021). Elle utilise l\u2019algorithme OC3 pour les eaux claires (O\u2019Reilly et al., 2019) et un autre algorithme semi-analytique bas\u00e9 sur la bande infrarouge pour les eaux turbides (Gons et al., 2015). \n\nLes images Sentinel-2 en vraies couleurs sont \u00e9galement extraites des images brutes (TCI) fournies par l\u2019ESA selon l\u2019emprise de la lagune cibl\u00e9e. Elles accompagnent les produits de turbidit\u00e9 et de concentration en chlorophylle afin d\u2019en faciliter l\u2019interpr\u00e9tation."], "spatial_resolution": "10 m"}, "ecologie:universe": true}, "featured": false, "frequency": "punctual", "frequency_date": null, "geopf": null, "harvest": {"backend": "CSW-ISO-19139", "created_at": "2024-11-12T00:00:00+00:00", "dct_identifier": "http://data.ofb.fr/a1137f49-4e20-4daf-b95b-5483b11d4707", "domain": "data.ofb.fr", "issued_at": "2024-11-12T00:00:00+00:00", "last_update": "2026-11-27T00:01:49.933000+00:00", "record_id": "12b44f84-3da4-4f70-9ed4-64f95da9abdb", "remote_id": "http://data.ofb.fr/a1137f49-4e20-4daf-b95b-5483b11d4707", "remote_url": "https://data.ofb.fr/catalogue/Donnees-geographiques-OFB/fre/catalog.search#/metadata/12b44f84-3da4-4f70-9ed4-64f95da9abdb", "source_id": "684af36aeb4fcb5ce4f438bc", "source_url": "https://data.ofb.fr/catalogue/Donnees-geographiques-OFB/fre/csw", "uri": "http://data.ofb.fr/a1137f49-4e20-4daf-b95b-5483b11d4707"}, "id": "6888c34b441fa32e35cf50bb", "internal": {"created_at_internal": "2025-07-29T12:49:15.207000+00:00", "last_modified_internal": "2026-10-02T13:57:58.676000+00:00"}, "last_modified": "2026-10-02T13:57:58.676000+00:00", "last_update": "2026-10-02T13:57:58.676000+00:00", "license": "notspecified", "metrics": {"dataservices": 0, "discussions": 0, "discussions_open": 0, "followers": 0, "followers_by_months": {"2025-01": 0, "2025-02": 0, "2025-03": 0, "2025-04": 0, "2025-05": 0, "2025-06": 0, "2025-07": 0, "2025-08": 0, "2025-09": 0, "2025-10": 0, "2025-11": 0, "2025-12": 0, "2026-01": 0}, "resources_downloads": 0, "reuses": 0, "reuses_by_months": {"2025-01": 0, "2025-02": 0, "2025-03": 0, "2025-04": 0, "2025-05": 0, "2025-06": 0, "2025-07": 0, "2025-08": 0, "2025-09": 0, "2025-10": 0, "2025-11": 0, "2025-12": 0, "2026-01": 0}, "views": 640}, "organization": {"acronym": "OFB", "badges": [{"kind": "certified"}, {"kind": "public-service"}], "class": "Organization", "id": "5d7f937b8b4c